  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU inclusive quality education for the most vulnerable children in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Overall objective of the Action is to contribute to ensuring that girls and boys in Sudan realize their right to quality, safe and inclusive primary education in a protective environment (impact level).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The action aims at supporting children, especially the most vulnerable and marginalised, such as children with disabilities and other groups, to access better, safer, and more inclusive education across 6 States of Sudan (North and Central Darfur, North and South Kordofan, Sennar and Khartoum). It includes four mutually reinforcing components/priorities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There are 4 priorities:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;O1 Improved access to inclusive, safe, protective and quality primary formal and non-formal education services for vulnerable boys and girls (SO1)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;O2 Improved availability and access to nutritious food for students in both formal and non-formal education, using locally produced food items&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;O3 Improved access to quality preventive and responsive protection services for girls and boys, both in schools and communities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;O4 Enhanced and accountable public investment for protecting and advancing children&apos;s rights&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
